        "backstory": {
          "v": "Gilbert was lent a clothespin on a windy HyperNorm morning and has treated it as evidence that the neighbours are not merely other addresses. The Men in Black prefer evidence of breaches; Hunky and Dory request measurable benefits. A contradictory card asked what gratitude produces. Gilbert cannot supply a figure. He can tell which resident needs their washing brought in before the rain.",
