        "backstory": {
          "v": "Alf arrived at the HyperNorm gathering early enough to practise being spontaneous. The Men in Black wanted an orderly occasion; Hunky and Dory supplied an approved level of enjoyment. A dissonant card made the neighbours laugh at something nobody had planned. Alf missed the joke, then joined the laughter. His hands remain uncertain, but he has stopped mistaking uncertainty for exclusion.",
